claim.claim-text:
using an adapter to mate a container of aerosol precursor composition with an aerosol delivery device having a refillable reservoir, wherein the adapter comprises:
a body defining a passageway between the container and the aerosol delivery device when the container is mated to the aerosol delivery device using the adapter, the passageway being for transfer of aerosol precursor composition from the container into the refillable reservoir; and
a valve located within the body and configured to be depressed during engagement of the container with the aerosol delivery device, wherein upon depression of the valve, aerosol precursor composition is thereby allowed to flow from the container through the passageway to the refillable reservoir;
